ind":"update","title":"Son of Beach Demo v0.7.1 &Full Version Development v0.6.0~0.8.0 Update","summary":"🎮 Demo Update🛠️ Character Animation Fix Fixed an issue that could cause incorrect character animations in the Demo.🌊 Full Version DevelopmentWe're continuing to expand Son of Beach with more tools, automation systems, and beach management features for the full release.⏳ Sand Sifter Vehicle A new sand-sifting vehicle is being developed to help clean large areas of the beach more efficiently.🧼 Cleaning Station A new cleaning station will allow you to process and clean collected items as part of yo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T09:23:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684177","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:25:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4880720-1846018067936411","game_id":"steam-4880720","kind":"update","title":"Son of Beach Demo v0.4.0~0.7.0 Update","summary":"What's New:🛠️ New Crafting Workbench A new crafting workbench is now available in-game!🐟 Seafood Order Improvements Seafood orders now include sardines, clownfish, and emperor angelfish, with adjusted requirements and rewards. Orders are free to accept—no deposit required! After completing an order, you can immediately accept another without waiting until the next day.🤿 Improved Swimming and Oxygen Detection Oxygen now drains only when your head is fully underwater and stops draining as soon as ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T14:34:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067936411","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:25:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4880720-1845383656394319","game_id":"steam-4880720","kind":"update","title":"Son of Beach – Full Version Develo