 vending machines are now available in-game.✨ Improved UI and Tool FeelUI, tool animations, and overall interaction responsiveness have been refined for a smoother experience.🌿 Bush Collision DisabledCollision with bushes has been removed for easier movement and exploration.🔧 Focus and Multi-Pocket Pickup FixesFixed focus-related issues and improved item retrieval from multiple pockets.🇷🇺 Russian Language AddedRussian language suppo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-30T14:50:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951307702","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:25:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4880720-1841579228671413","game_id":"steam-4880720","kind":"update","title":"Son of Beach Demo v0.2.1 Update","summary":"What's New:🏪 Collectibles Merchant Arrives A new collectibles merchant has moved in, offering collectible appraisal and market-stall rental services. More cleaning-related gameplay will be added in future updates.⚙️ Major Performance and Character Improvements Significant optimizations to overall performance and character presentation for a smoother, more natural gameplay experience.🕒 Longer In-Game Days Each in-game day now lasts 20 minutes. Players can also choose to sleep as early as the even","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-22T13:21:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228671413","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:25:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4880720-1840310314345484","game_id":"steam-4880720","kind":"update","title":"🌊 Son of Beach – Major Diving Update V0.2.0","summary":"🤿 A diving merchant has arrived, opening the way to a brand-new underwater world!🗑️ Beach Cleanup: Large amounts of trash have washed up on the beach and urgently need to be cleared. Clean it up, recycle it, and restore the beach to its former beauty!🤿 Relaxing Diving: Unlock diving equipment and explore new underwater areas.🧹 Ocean Cleanup: Use your tools to remove underwater trash and scrape away encrusted barnacles, restoring the ocean’s cleanliness and beauty.🦀 Coastal Foraging: Explore the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-07T16:05:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314345484","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:25:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4880720-1839041357031844","game_id":"steam-4880720","kind":"update","title":"Son of Beach Demo v0.1.2 Update","summary":"What's New:🐠 Clownfish Test in Shallow Waters Added a test version of clownfish visuals in the offshore area.🗑️ Trash Bag Task Item Tracking Added item index tracking for tasks that require carrying trash bags.🏪 Merchant Position Reset Improvements Improved merchant placeholder positioning and reset behavior.🚁 Drone Tool Switching Added the ability to switch tools while using the drone.📍 Drone Marking Feature Tutorial Added guidance and hints for the drone marking feature.📋 Higher Paper Trash Bo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-25T12:08:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357031844","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:25:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4880720-1838407329263176","game_id":"steam-4880720","kind":"update","title":"Son of Beach Demo v0.1.1 Update","summary":"What's New:🚁 Drone Technology Adjustments Adjusted drone-related technologies for a better progression experience.🐝 Drone Sleep Issue Fix Fixed an issue where the drone could get stuck while sleeping.🚶 NPC Stuck Issue Fix Fixed an issue where pedestrians could become stuck.📡 Metal Detector Sound Adjustment Adjusted the detector volume for a better audio experience.⏰ Longer Daytime Increased the length of each day by 1 minute.Thank you all for playing the Son of Beach Demo and sharing your feedba","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-19T07:07:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329263176","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:25:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4880720-1838407329262482","game_id":"steam-4880720","kind":"update","title":"Son of Beach Demo v0.1.0 Update","summary":"What's New:🌟 New Seafood Shop & Seafood Bounties Added a new seafood shop merchant and seafood bounty tasks.🦀 New Sea Creatures Added crabs and razor clams for players to discover and collect.📖 Technology Tree Tutorials & Video Preview Added video previews and tutorials to help players better understand the technology tree.🎯 Mouse Sensitivity Settings Added mouse sensitivity adjustment options.✨ Sea Level Flashing Bug Fix Fixed an issue causing unwanted flashing effects on the sea surface.🌅 Impr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-18T19:19:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329262482","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:25:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4880720-1836506165583570","game_id":"steam-4880720","kind":"update","title":"Son of Beach Demo v0.04~v0.0.6 Update","summary":"What's New:🌟 Technology Tree UI Updated Redesigned the technology tree with a cleaner and more intuitive layout.🌍 New Language Support Added support for Japanese, Korean, Spanish, Portuguese (Brazil), German, French, and Polish.📋 Bounty Task Improvements Improved the level bounty task system for a smoother progression experience.🌊 Tides Now Restore t